@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Realtime Connector: строго один event до terminal acceptance

autonumber
participant "Zulip supported queue" as Zulip
participant "Realtime Connector\nwhole-account lease" as Realtime
participant "Private Workspace API" as API
database "Canonical state + idempotency + outbox" as DB
participant "Workspace projection worker" as Worker
database "Durable ready events" as Events
participant "WebSocket dispatcher" as WS
participant "Workspace client" as Client

loop Строго последовательный loop
  Realtime -> Zulip : receive next supported event
  Realtime -> Realtime : exact type/op -> one command
  loop До terminal acceptance
    Realtime -> API : mTLS command(provider object/event key,\norigin/causation, account generation)
    API -> API : verify certificate identity/generation;\nthen assignment/account lease/scope
    alt actual state transition
      API -> DB : canonical mutation + immutable outbox
      API --> Realtime : applied
    else repeated/older state
      API -> DB : idempotency/version check, no mutation
      API --> Realtime : duplicate / stale
    else transient/ambiguous
      API --> Realtime : retryable
      Realtime -> Realtime : backoff; same key; do not read next
    else classified permanent failure
      API -> DB : durable safe failure / DLQ evidence
      API --> Realtime : permanent
    end
  end

  opt Actual outbox transition
    DB -> Worker : immutable one-event task
    Worker -> DB : projection update
    Worker -> Events : ready public event
    note over Worker,Events
      Projection и ready event commit
      в одной transaction.
    end note
    WS -> Events : cursor replay/live read
    WS -> Client : at-least-once current-contract event
  end
end

note over Zulip,Realtime
  Queue expiry, missing heartbeat, restart или web_reload_client
  повторяют единый bootstrap с новой queue/boundary.
end note

note over Realtime,WS
  Bridge не делает fan-out/projections и не доставляет WebSocket.
  Membership/archive/delete command передаёт provider fact;
  Workspace сам решает history/bindings/visibility policy.
  Duplicate/no-op не создаёт outbox или public event.
end note

note over Zulip,API
  Presence/status changes доставляются последовательно.
  Last confirmed wins; origin/causation suppresses echo only.
  mTLS authenticates Bridge; lease separately authorizes account ownership.
end note

@enduml
